    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "CONTROLS:\n  \u2022 [A] / [D] or [Left / Right Arrows] : Move Left & Right\n 
    \u2022 [Space] / [W] / [Up Arrow] : Jump (Hold for higher jump)\n  \u2022 [E]
    : Pull Hidden Lever\n  \u2022 [Escape] : Pause Game & View Menu\n\nMISSION OBJECTIVES:\n 
    1. Traverse the castle library shelves and avoid spike hazards.\n  2. You have
    5 LIVES per level. Falling into spikes costs 1 life.\n  3. Ascend to the high
    library gallery to find the hidden lever.\n  4. Press [E] to pull the lever and
    slide open the secret vault door.\n  5. Enter the secret room and recover the
    Time Crystal!"
